rex-file-paste is derived from rex-image-paste by Pablo Ortiz (pablasso),
distributed under the MIT License. It keeps its transfer mechanism: a Rex
action on the Mac, a clipboard read with JXA, a hidden terminal running
`base64 -d` on the remote server, a SHA-256 check, and a bracketed paste.

